 Keys                                                                               F1 or Esc close

  Move                            Hunks                           Files
  j k        line down, up        J K        next, previous       w          save
  Ctrl-d u   half page            ]c [c      next, previous       e          open in $EDITOR
  gg G       top, bottom          >          copy to right        q          quit
  ← →        scroll sideways      <          copy to left         Q          quit, don't save
  Tab        other pane           u          undo                 Ctrl-c     abort, exit 1
                                  Ctrl-r     redo
  Search
  / ?        forward, back        View
  n N        next, previous       v          switch view
  Esc        clear matches        W          whitespace mode




  When whitespace is ignored, whitespace-only changes are hidden and can't be copied.

 1/4   whitespace off  LF | LF
